id: pm-graph-gzw9
title: Adopt pm-cli 2026.7.27 dependency ranges
description: Bump @unbrained/pm-cli peer and dev dependency ranges from 2026.7.26 to 2026.7.27 and adapt the output_format service override to the 2026.7.27 contract.
